<title>USA: Oklahoma Cty ISD 12, Okla., won by James Baker.</title>
<headline>Oklahoma Cty ISD 12, Okla., won by James Baker.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>James Baker &amp; Associates said it won $6.860 million of Oklahoma Cty ISD 12, Okla., building bonds, of 1997 Seris B, with a net interest cost of 4.7514 percent.</p>
</text>
